	(text "Audio\nNS4150B x2 from VBAT_SW, outputs bridged (BTL): no speaker wire to GND, no shared return.\nInputs: the module's differential speaker outputs (SPOL/SPOR) through 100n + 100k per leg;\n  gain = 240k / Rin = 2.4 (raise it in the codec, or lower Rin to 47k for 5.1).\nCTRL = AMP_EN (GPIO21, high = on); R421 keeps the amps off while the ESP32 boots.\nSupply: 10u + 1u at each amp, C421 470u bulk next to them.\nNo headphone output: the module's HPOUTL/R are left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
